   "people": [
    "louis-xiv"
   ],
   "t": "The Louvre began around 1200 as a fortress. Kings turned it into a palace, and when Louis XIV moved to Versailles it filled with artists and academies. The Revolution opened it to the public as a museum in 1793.",
